ISO/IEC 27001
-------------

src/iso27001/schema/*.yaml, src/iso27001/datamodel/ and project/ model
the records an organization keeps to run an information security
management system to ISO/IEC 27001:2022, Information security,
cybersecurity and privacy protection - Information security management
systems - Requirements (third edition, 2022-10), with Amendment 1:2024,
Climate action changes. They are this project's own work, written in its
own words, and cite the standard's clauses and Annex A controls by number
only. They reproduce no text of the standard, which is copyright ISO and
IEC, and they are not endorsed by ISO or IEC. This repository's licence
grants no right to reproduce or redistribute that text; obtain the
standard and any licence to reuse its text from ISO or your national
standards body.

src/iso27001/schema/iso27001-overlay.template.yaml lists the schema's
elements with empty placeholders and holds no text of the standard. A
licence holder may fill a private copy of it, which .gitignore keeps out
of this repository; that copy must never be committed or distributed.

